: </strong>Command immortal anthropomorphic heroes inspired by European folklore. Each hero offers a distinct playstyle. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hybrid Unit Builds:</strong> Cross-spec your units with two randomly assigned specialization trees. Choose abilities from either tree as your units level up to create unique tactical builds. In addition to their ability trees, units can also gain unique talents, enabling deeper specialization and powerful build synergies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath: </strong>Your Aegis return after defeat, but your other units do not. Fallen soldiers are lost for the rest of the campaign. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overworld Flow: </strong>Advance across the realm one day at a time. Manage your army’s composition, prepare for daily assaults, develop your regions and make difficult decisions to gain advantages for the final defense.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemy Generals:</strong> The siege unfolds across three escalating phases, each ending with an enemy general. Each general strengthens the invading army with unique army-wide effects and battle tactics, forcing you to constantly adapt before facing the Emperor. </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Defend humanity’s last stronghold in this turn-based tactical roguelite. Adapt to enemy tactics, develop your immortal heroes and their mortal allies. Govern, upgrade and protect your realm. Survive long enough to break the curse behind this endless war.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Dutch, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126750/ca83653ed637ecaab77f5c30009883d3b0289d57/header.jpg?t=1787412091", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4126750/765dff4422eaca081e674df9f7e874cda8fbeca